  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Agribusiness Reverse Trade Mission Series, through Global Marketing &amp; Communications, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This series of two reverse trade missions (RTMs) will familiarize public and/or private sector representatives from Sub-Saharan Africa with the latest U.S. technologies, services, and best practices in the agribusiness sector. The RTMs will include meetings with U.S. industry representatives, associations, financial institutions, and U.S. government agencies. This funding in the amount of $23,333 is being added to Agribusiness Reverse Trade Mission Series.</narrative>
  </description>
